      "title": "3 \u2014 EDIT PROMPT: say exactly what belongs inside the mask",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Edit only the white masked region. Preserve the original crop's camera perspective, pose, identity, body proportions, skin tone, lighting, shadows, texture, clothing and every unmasked detail.\n\nREPAIR TASK: Reconstruct the same visible hand, naturally attached to the existing wrist, as an anatomically correct relaxed two-finger peace sign. Exactly five fingers total: index and middle fingers extended and separated; thumb, ring finger and little finger naturally folded toward the palm. Realistic palm, knuckles, joints, nails and finger lengths. Match the original wrist angle, perspective, sunlight and smartphone-photo texture. Do not alter the forearm, watch, hair, face, body or background."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Edit only the white masked region. Preserve the original crop's camera perspective, pose, identity, body proportions, skin tone, lighting, shadows, texture, clothing and every unmasked detail.\n\nREPAIR TASK: Reconstruct the same visible hand, naturally attached to the existing wrist, as an anatomically correct relaxed two-finger peace sign. Exactly five fingers total: index and middle fingers extended and separated; thumb, ring finger and little finger naturally folded toward the palm. Realistic palm, knuckles, joints, nails and finger lengths. Match the original wrist angle, perspective, sunlight and smartphone-photo texture. Do not alter the forearm, watch, hair, face, body or background."
      },
